<section class="band prose"><h1>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
<h2>Plans are prepaid</h2><p>Each plan is paid in advance for one month or one year. There is no free trial and no automatic renewal.</p>
<h2>Cancellation</h2><p>You can cancel at any time by simply not renewing. Cancelling stops future renewal; your plan stays active until the end of the period you paid for, followed by the grace period on your plan. We do not delete your data when a plan ends.</p>
<h2>Refunds</h2><p>We do not give refunds for a period that has already started, except for duplicate or erroneous charges. If you were charged twice or charged in error, we refund the extra or wrong amount within 7 business days to the original payment method.</p>
<h2>How to ask</h2><p>Email <x-site.biz key="email"/> from your account email address with the date and amount of the charge. See also <a href="/contact">Contact</a>.</p></section>
